---
import MaterialIcon from "../MaterialIcon.astro";
---

<section
  class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#171717] py-20 text-white sm:py-32"
  aria-labelledby="distribution-title"
>
  <div
    class="tv-distribution-aura pointer-events-none absolute left-1/2 top-1/2 size-170 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full border"
  >
  </div>
  <div
    class="relative mx-auto w-[min(100%-2.5rem,106rem)] sm:w-[min(100%-4rem,70rem)]"
  >
    <header data-tv-reveal class="mx-auto max-w-4xl text-center">
      <p data-section-kicker class="text-[#be64ff]">DISTRIBUCIÓN INTELIGENTE</p><h2
        id="distribution-title"
        class="mt-6 leading-[.94] text-white"
      >
        Amplifica tu señal
      </h2><p class="mt-6 leading-relaxed text-[#d0bbdf]">
        Envía tu programación a los destinos que necesitas y conserva el control
        de toda tu emisión en un solo panel.
      </p>
    </header>
    <div class="mt-16 grid gap-7 lg:grid-cols-[1.1fr_.9fr]">
      <article
        data-tv-reveal
        class="overflow-hidden rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/1 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(88,33,127,.45),rgba(23,23,23,.5))] p-6  backdrop-blur-md sm:p-6"
      >
        <div
          class="relative h-62 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl  sm:h-70"
        >
          <div
            class="tv-distribution-core absolute left-1/2 top-[23%] size-18 -translate-x-1/2 rounded-3xl bg-[#b651ff] shadow-[0_0_40px_rgb(182_81_255_/_45%)]"
          >
            <span class="grid size-full place-items-center"
              ><MaterialIcon name="settings_input_antenna" size={36} /></span>
          </div>
          <span
            class="tv-destination absolute left-[13%] top-[21%] rounded-full border border-[#bd60ff]/50 bg-[#382a42]/90 px-4 py-2 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm"
            >Señal RTMP</span
          ><span
            class="tv-destination absolute right-[10%] top-[21%] rounded-full border border-[#bd60ff]/50 bg-[#382a42]/90 px-4 py-2 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm"
            >Destino 01</span
          ><span
            class="tv-destination absolute left-[20%] bottom-[18%] rounded-full border border-[#bd60ff]/50 bg-[#382a42]/90 px-4 py-2 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm"
            >Destino 02</span
          ><span
            class="tv-destination absolute right-[17%] bottom-[18%] rounded-full border border-[#bd60ff]/50 bg-[#382a42]/90 px-4 py-2 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm"
            >Destino 03</span
          >
          <svg
            class="absolute inset-0 size-full"
            viewBox="0 0 600 300"
            fill="none"
            aria-hidden="true"
            ><path
              class="tv-distribution-path"
              d="M130 78 C250 80 260 100 300 115 M470 78 C350 80 340 100 300 115 M170 238 C250 220 260 188 300 165 M430 238 C350 220 340 188 300 165"
              stroke="#c36fff"
              stroke-opacity=".6"
              stroke-dasharray="5 7"></path></svg
          >
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-9 text-2xl">Destinos configurables</h3><p
          class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-[#cfb8df]"
        >
          Configura plataformas de simulcast para distribuir tu canal a varios
          destinos desde la misma emisión.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article
        data-tv-reveal
        class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/1 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(72,27,105,.42),rgba(23,23,23,.52))] p-6 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-6"
      >
        <div
          class="relative grid h-62 place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl  sm:h-70"
        >
          <span
            class="tv-ecosystem-core relative grid size-20 place-items-center rounded-full bg-[#b956ff] text-white shadow-[0_0_42px_rgb(185_86_255_/_46%)]"
            ><MaterialIcon name="tv" size={38} /></span
          ><div class="absolute bottom-9 flex gap-3">
            <span
              class="tv-ecosystem-chip rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm"
              ><MaterialIcon
                name="live_tv"
                size={17}
                class="mr-1 inline text-[#daa7ff]"
              />Canal</span
            ><span
              class="tv-ecosystem-chip rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm"
              ><MaterialIcon
                name="play_circle"
                size={17}
                class="mr-1 inline text-[#daa7ff]"
              />Player</span
            ><span
              class="tv-ecosystem-chip rounded-xl bg-white/10 px-4 py-2 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm"
              ><MaterialIcon
                name="analytics"
                size={17}
                class="mr-1 inline text-[#daa7ff]"
              />Analíticas</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-9 text-2xl">Un ecosistema para tu canal</h3><p
          class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-[#cfb8df]"
        >
          Combina emisión en vivo, VOD, reproductor y analíticas para ofrecer
          una experiencia completa a tu audiencia.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article
        data-tv-reveal
        class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/1 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(84,20,130,.42),rgba(23,23,23,.52))] p-6 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-6"
      >
        <div
          class="relative h-62 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl p-6 sm:h-70"
        >
          <div
            class="absolute left-6 right-6 top-8 flex items-center justify-between"
          >
            <span class="font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm font-bold text-[#e1b6ff]"
              >LISTA DE PROGRAMACIÓN</span
            ><span
              class="tv-live-status rounded-full bg-[#b54dff]/25 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-[#dba9ff]"
              >ACTIVA</span>
          </div><div class="absolute left-6 right-6 top-20 grid gap-3">
            {
              ["Noticias en vivo", "Espacio cultural", "Programa musical"].map(
                (show, index) => (
                  <div class="tv-schedule-row flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/8 bg-white/5 px-4 py-3">
                    <>
                      <span class="tv-schedule-index grid size-7 place-items-center rounded-lg text-xs">
                        {index + 1}
                      </span>
                      <span class="font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm">{show}</span>
                      <span class="ml-auto text-xs text-[#b79cca]">
                        {index === 0 ? "EN VIVO" : "Próximo"}
                      </span>
                    </>
                  </div>
                ),
              )
            }
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-9 text-2xl">Programación organizada</h3><p
          class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-[#cfb8df]"
        >
          Organiza listas, spots y avances TV para mantener una programación
          consistente en tu canal.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article
        data-tv-reveal
        class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-white/1 bg-[linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(81,39,111,.42),rgba(23,23,23,.52))] p-6 backdrop-blur-md sm:p-6"
      >
        <div
          class="relative grid h-62 place-items-center overflow-hidden rounded-2xl sm:h-70"
        >
          <span
            class="tv-recording-indicator absolute left-7 top-7 rounded-lg bg-[#ff3d5b] px-3 py-1 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-xs font-bold"
            >REC</span
          ><div
            class="tv-vod-core grid size-25 place-items-center rounded-full border border-[#d191ff]/45 bg-[#a451df]/20 shadow-[0_0_44px_rgb(186_89_255_/_24%)]"
          >
            <MaterialIcon name="movie" size={48} class="text-[#deafff]" />
          </div><div
            class="tv-vod-label absolute bottom-8 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-xl border border-white/12 bg-black/20 px-5 py-3 font-[var(--fuente-principal)] text-sm text-[#cfc3d8]"
          >
            <MaterialIcon
              name="cloud_done"
              size={20}
              class="text-[#d59bff]"
            />Contenido disponible bajo demanda
          </div>
        </div>
        <h3 class="mt-9 text-2xl">Tu emisión se convierte en VOD</h3><p
          class="mt-4 leading-relaxed text-[#cfb8df]"
        >
          Activa la grabación automática y conserva tus transmisiones para que
          tu audiencia las disfrute cuando quiera.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
